ng, chocks, cones, meet and assist, flight paperwork and local flight plan filing, coordination, movement messages. In the total: pushback 350, toilet 325, water 300, waste 175, belt loader 200 (Conveyor Belt row), GPU 325 and ACU 350 per hour, ASU 350, headset 175, passenger steps 300, supervision 400 (supervision always in the basket, user rule), VIP lounge incl. customs one way 265 adult / 135 child. Ticked: towing 550, tow bar 150, ramp transportation 100 one way, baggage cart 100, crew transport to hotel 325, nitrogen 270, oxygen 330, catering handover 225, pre-arrange fuel / catering 225, landing / overflight permit 150, slot 50, Travizory immigration & health 80 per pax, wheelchair 125. After hours +50% of handling 22:00–05:00 on weekdays, all day Saturday, Sunday and public holidays. Disbursement 15% on airport fees. Airport fees as at Air Seychelles (SCAA tariff; Euro Aviation gives none). SCAA AIRPORT CHARGES (received 24 Nov 2026, in SR): landing 27 SR per started ton 10–60 t (min 550 SR) = 1.8859 USD per ton in the panel; parking 7.50 SR per 45 m² per started 24 h after the first 6 h free (6 h free added for both handlers); night landing or take-off 19:00–05:30 +40% of landing per movement (new rows, automatic in the Surcharge section, both handlers); departing pax 50 USD (non-resident), disembarkation levy 15 USD; health tax 50 USD per arriving pax (new ticked row, usually paid by passengers via Travizory); en-route navigation by distance flown in the FIR not entered. Row 'HM Ramp Bus' renamed 'Ramp Bus / Transportation (one way)'.","services":[{"airport":false,"disb":false,"name":"Handling Fee","qty":true,"qtyDef":1,"unit":"flight"},{"airport":false,"disb":false,"name":"Pushback","qty":true,"qtyDef":1,"unit":"flight"},{"airport":false,"disb":false,"name":"Towing","qty":true,"qtyDef":1,"unit":"flight"},{"airport":false,"disb":false,"name":"Toilet Service","qty":true,"qtyDef":1,"unit":"flight"},{"airport":false,"disb":false,"name":"Potable Water","qty":t